{"type":"standard","title":"Sean McCann (politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sean McCann (politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q16213620","titles":{"canonical":"Sean_McCann_(politician)","normalized":"Sean McCann (politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sean McCann (politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":40472866,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374209177","tid":"f326d7b6-ad25-11f1-a322-ad878ea0d790","timestamp":"2026-09-10T14:43:13Z","description":"American politician (born 1971)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_McCann_(politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_McCann_(politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_McCann_(politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sean_McCann_(politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_McCann_(politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Sean_McCann_(politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sean_McCann_(politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sean_McCann_(politician)"}},"extract":"Sean Andrew McCann is the senator for the Michigan Senate's 19th district. He formerly represented the 20th senate district. He is a former member of the Michigan House of Representatives, who represented the 60th district. He is a member of the Democratic Party. McCann is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 election in Michigan's 4th congressional district.","extract_html":"<p><b>Sean Andrew McCann</b> is the senator for the Michigan Senate's 19th district. He formerly represented the 20th senate district. He is a former member of the Michigan House of Representatives, who represented the 60th district. He is a member of the Democratic Party. McCann is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 election in Michigan's 4th congressional district.</p>"}